{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/spelthorne-borough-council-letter-to-the-leader-of-the-council-15-july-2026","content_id":"3c2f19ee-c1c5-4335-bbf0-b8268ea83b22","description":"Letter to the Leader of Spelthorne Borough Council, confirming the decision to establish a single commissioner team across Woking and Spelthorne and publication of the second Commissioners’ report.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a57609b2cbe5d1c179a6528","filename":"Spelthorne_letter_to_the_Leader_of_the_Council_-_July_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":220931,"filename":"Spelthorne_letter_to_the_Leader_of_the_Council_-_July_2026.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9402424","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Spelthorne Borough Council: Letter to the Leader of the Council","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a57609b2cbe5d1c179a6528/Spelthorne_letter_to_the_Leader_of_the_Council_-_July_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>A letter from the Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness, Alison McGovern MP, to the Leader of Spelthorne Borough Council confirming the decision to move to a single commissioner team to work across Woking and Spelthorne by appointing Lesley Seary as Lead Commissioner for Woking, Deborah McLaughlin as Regeneration and Housing Commissioner for Woking, Barry Scarr as Finance Commissioner for Spelthorne and publication of the Commissioners’ second report.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T14:08:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9402424"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-15T15